## 🧪 **TESTING PERFETTO**

### **COVERAGE TARGET PERFETTO**
- Statement: >98%
- Branch: >95%
- Function: >99%
- Lines: >98%

### **SCRIPT CONTROLLO QUALITÀ PERFETTA**
```bash
npm run pre-modifiche          # BLOCCO se errori - OBBLIGATORIO
npm run post-modifiche         # BLOCCO se problemi - OBBLIGATORIO  
npm run conta-problemi         # DEVE essere = 0 - SEMPRE
npm run test:perfect-system    # Test sistema perfetto
npm run immunity-check         # Verifica immunità totale
```

### **TEMPLATE TEST SISTEMA PERFETTO**
```typescript
describe('Sistema Perfetto', () => {
  it('should render perfectly on all devices', () => {
    const { getByText } = render(
      <PerfectText size={32} lines={2} immunity={true}>
        Testo perfetto
      </PerfectText>
    );
    
    const textElement = getByText('Testo perfetto');
    expect(textElement.props.allowFontScaling).toBe(false);
    expect(textElement.props.numberOfLines).toBe(2);
  });
  
  it('should support perfect dark mode', () => {
    const { getByText } = render(
      <UniversalThemeProvider>
        <PerfectContainer theme="auto">
          <PerfectText color="auto">Auto theme text</PerfectText>
        </PerfectContainer>
      </UniversalThemeProvider>
    );
    
    expect(getByText('Auto theme text')).toBeTruthy();
  });
  
  it('should maintain immunity completely', () => {
    const status = SystemImmunity.checkImmunityStatus();
    
    expect(status.fontScaling).toBe(true);    // Blocked
    expect(status.dynamicType).toBe(true);    // Blocked
    expect(status.accessibility).toBe(true);  // Controlled
    expect(status.systemTheme).toBe(true);    // Overridden
  });
});
```

